hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1052","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs ka haq nahi jis ke paas koi cheez ho jis mein wo wasiyyat kare ke wo do raatein guzare magar us ki wasiyyat us ke paas likhi hui ho."
"1053","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Hajjat al-Wada ke saal meri ayadat kar rahe they, us dard mein jo mujhe sakht tha. Phir main ne arz kiya: Mujhe dard pahunch chuka hai jabke main maal wala hun. Aur meri ek beti ke siwa koi waris nahi hai. To kya main apne maal mein se do tihayi sadqa kar dun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Phir main ne arz kiya: Aadha? To Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Phir farmaya: Tihayi, aur tihayi badi ya zyada hai. Beshak tum apne warison ko ghani chhoro ye behtar hai ke tum unhe mohtaj chhoro jo logon se mangte phirein. Aur beshak tum jo kharch karoge jis se Allah ka chehra chahte ho us par tumhe ajr diya jayega, yahan tak ke jo tum apni biwi ke munh mein rakhte ho. Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main apne sathiyon ke peechhe chhora jaunga? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum peechhe nahi chhore jaoge aur nek amal karoge magar us se darja aur bulandi mein badhoge. Phir shayad tum peechhe chhore jao yahan tak ke tum se qaumein faida uthayein aur doosri tum se nuqsan uthayein. Ae Allah! Mere sathiyon ki hijrat poori farma aur unhe un ki ediyon par wapas na kar. Lekin bechara Sa'd bin Khaula. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us par rehem farmate hain ke wo Makkah mein faut hua."
"1054","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Kash log chauthayi ki taraf kam karte. Kyunke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tihayi, aur tihayi zyada ya badi hai."
"1055","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se arz kiya: Beshak meri walida ki jaan achanak qabz ho gayi. Aur main gumaan karta hun ke agar wo bolteen to sadqa karteen. To kya un ke liye ajr hai agar main un ki taraf se sadqa karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan."
"1056","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin al-Khattab ne Khaibar mein zameen payi. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye taake us mein Aap se mashwara lein. Phir unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main ne Khaibar mein zameen payi hai. Main ne kabhi us se umda maal nahi paya jo mere nazdeek hai. Phir tum is ke bare mein kya hukm farmate ho? Aap ne farmaya: Agar chaho to us ki asl ko rok lo aur use sadqa karo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Umar ne use sadqa kiya ke wo becha na jaye, hadiya na kiya jaye, wirsa na ho. Aur use faqiron mein, rishtedaron mein, gardanon mein, Allah ke raste mein, musafir aur mehmaan mein sadqa kiya. Jo us ka wali ho us par us mein se maroof se khane aur khilane mein koi gunah nahi, maal jama kiye baghair. Unhon ne kaha [rawi]: Phir main ne isے Ibn Sirin se bayan kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Maal jama kiye baghair."
"1057","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Aufa se Talha bin Musarrif ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Abi Aufa se poochha: Kya Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wasiyyat farmayi thi? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Phir main ne kaha: Logon par wasiyyat kaise likhi gayi, ya unhe wasiyyat ka hukm diya gaya? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne Allah ki kitab ki wasiyyat farmayi."
"1058","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Aswad ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aisha ke paas zikr hua ke Ali (raziyallahu anhu) wali they. To unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne kab unhe wasiyyat farmayi jabke main Aap ko apne seene se lagaye thi? Ya unhon ne kaha: Meri god mein. Phir Aap ne tasht mangwaya. Phir Aap meri god mein jhuk gaye. Phir mujhe ilm na hua ke Wo faut ho gaye. Phir Unhon ne kab unhe wasiyyat farmayi?"
"1059","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jumeraat ka din, Jumeraat ka din kya hai? Phir roye yahan tak ke un ke aansu ne kankariyon ko tar kar diya. Phir unhon ne kaha: Jumeraat ke din Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka dard sakht ho gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Mere paas kitab lao, tumhare liye kitab likh dun jis ke baad tum kabhi gumrah nahi hoge. Phir wo jhagde. Aur Nabi ke paas jhagda jayez nahi. Phir unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) behki behki baatein kar rahe hain. Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe chhoro. Jo main mein hun wo us se behtar hai jis ki taraf tum mujhe bulate ho. Aur Aap ne wafat ke waqt teen wasiyyat farmayein: Mushrikon ko Jazirat al-Arab se nikalo, wafd ko izzat do jaisa main unhe izzat deta tha. Aur teesri main bhool gaya."
"1060","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas hazri hui jabke ghar mein mard they. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aao, tumhare liye kitab likh dun jis ke baad tum gumrah nahi hoge. Phir un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par dard ghalib aa gaya hai. Aur tumhare paas Quran hai. Hamein Allah ki kitab kafi hai. Phir ghar wale ikhtilaf karne lage aur jhagadne lage. Phir un mein se koi kehta: Qareeb karo, tumhare liye kitab likhein jis ke baad tum gumrah nahi hoge. Aur un mein se koi is ke siwa kehta. Phir jab unhon ne laghw aur ikhtilaf zyada kiya to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Utho. Ubaidullah ne kaha [rawi]: Phir Ibn Abbas kehte they: Beshak museebat tamam museebat wo hai jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur un ke un ke liye wo kitab likhne ke darmiyan hail hui, un ke ikhtilaf aur shor ki wajah se."
